{
  "label": "day263",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label day263:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene kandasoutside1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/kandasoutside1.webp",
      "alt": "kandasoutside1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, well, well...Would you look who we have here?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Am I being mugged?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I run into the Kanda sisters on my way home from[school], who are about to shake me down for all I am worth if we’re basing the rest of this event on Kirin’s first line of dialogue.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes. Give us all of your money.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We need to buy cigarettes and guns and other stuff that we’re definitely into despite our outwardly adorable appearances.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I see.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Karin, are you in on this too?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Karin?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene kandasoutside2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/kandasoutside2.webp",
      "alt": "kandasoutside2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Talking is hard.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m just going to stand here and let Kirin take your money.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I will buy lunch from the convenience store and eat all by myself, letting the snow pile up over my body and carry me off to a new life.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, you don’t actually need money, do you? Because I’m not giving you any.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene kandasoutside3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/kandasoutside3.webp",
      "alt": "kandasoutside3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh...no.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How come everyone else is able to come up to you after[school] but the second I do it, you think you’re being mugged?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How would I even mug you? Have you seen me? I’m like a third of your size.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": To be honest, I feel a lot safer knowing it’s just you against me now. Karin was the one I was worried about.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene kandasoutside4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/kandasoutside4.webp",
      "alt": "kandasoutside4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why are you worried about her and not me?!",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why are you worried about me to begin with?! What did I do wrong?!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Relax, soccer sisters. No one is fighting anyone today.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene kandasoutside5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/kandasoutside5.webp",
      "alt": "kandasoutside5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...What did you just call us?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Soccer sisters...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I love it.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I personally prefer that the people I’m talking to use my actual name, but it’s whatever, I guess.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene kandasoutside6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/kandasoutside6.webp",
      "alt": "kandasoutside6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What are you up to? Going home early?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Early? I’m going home at the same time I always do.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Really? Don’t you normally sit in your fancy office chair after[school] and wait for girls to show up and “talk?”",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If the nurse can take Fridays off, so can I.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, right. I forgot the first year teachers also acted as counselors.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that not how it works for your grade?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We just have one counselor who handles all of the classes.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Probably because everyone has already resigned themselves to how much [high_school] sucks by the second year and is tired of complaining about it.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene kandasoutside7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/kandasoutside7.webp",
      "alt": "kandasoutside7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But vulnerable, impressionable girls like myself rely on our teachers to make us feel better about the things that ail us. Right, Sensei?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, but in an incredibly roundabout way.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’ve...been seeing a guidance counselor?",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Kirin, I don’t know if you’re joking, but-",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, Sensei, have you heard the news?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene kandasoutside8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/kandasoutside8.webp",
      "alt": "kandasoutside8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": News? What news?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A certain “soccer sister” might be changing classes soon.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? You’re not in Ms. Watabe’s class, are you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I was at the beginning of the year but she axed me like, right off the bat.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So they moved me to class C, but I’ve been really obnoxious in there because that teacher sucks even more.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, by process of elimination, I’ve got a preeeeetty good chance of ending up with you next.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Unless they just decide to expel me instead. But a mind is a terrible thing to waste and blah blah blah adult-speak.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is there an open seat next to Ayane, by any chance?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hold on a second. I can’t tell if you’re actually being serious right now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene kandasoutside9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/kandasoutside9.webp",
      "alt": "kandasoutside9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You need me to spell it out for you?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I, Kirin Kanda, have been intentionally provoking teachers to try and wind up in your class since the first time I heard Miku talk about you.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Couldn’t you have just...asked for a transfer?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A - There is literally zero fun in that.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": B - If a girl just asks to be transferred into the hot teacher’s class, literally everyone will start to think “you know what” is going on.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene kandasoutside10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/kandasoutside10.webp",
      "alt": "kandasoutside10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who knows what? I don’t follow.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m saying that people are going to think I want to fuck him.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene kandasoutside11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/kandasoutside11.webp",
      "alt": "kandasoutside11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Kirin!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just because he’s also our coach doesn’t mean you can say such vulgar things in front of him!",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why not? He doesn’t care at all. Right, Sensei?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s true. I really don’t.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course he doesn’t care. It’s not his reputation at stake if someone hears that.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, I know people around here don’t exactly think too highly of me, but something like that would definitely still have some effect on my reputation.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene kandasoutside12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/kandasoutside12.webp",
      "alt": "kandasoutside12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oooooh, okay...Okay. You just don’t want somebody to hear me saying anything inappropriate because it will make you look bad. Gotcha.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m worried about what people will think of you. I don’t care what anyone has to say about me.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene kandasoutside13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/kandasoutside13.webp",
      "alt": "kandasoutside13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Easy for you to say when-",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene kandasoutside14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/kandasoutside14.webp",
      "alt": "kandasoutside14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ugh...Just forget about it.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Anyway, Sensei, point is that you shouldn’t be surprised if I suddenly wind up switching classes again.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll do my best to be a model student so I don’t embarrass you the same way I embarrass my older sister.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene kandasoutside15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/kandasoutside15.webp",
      "alt": "kandasoutside15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? Why are you looking at me like that?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Your face is really red all of a sudden.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It is not.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you two fight like this often?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. This is the first time ever.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that sarcasm?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course it’s fucking sarcasm. Why are we even talking about this right now?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You should be celebrating that I jumped through so many hoops for the chance to study under you.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene kandasoutside16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/kandasoutside16.webp",
      "alt": "kandasoutside16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Doesn’t it sound fun to have one more girl under you, Sensei?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m leaving now.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you coming home tonight or do I have to tell Mom to wrap your food in advance so you can eat whenever you decide to show up instead?",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The latter, please. I had plans with some friends tonight anyway.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sure you did.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene kandasoutside17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/kandasoutside17.webp",
      "alt": "kandasoutside17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Karin redirects her gaze from the ground to me and stares into my eyes for significantly longer than she ever has before.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Normally, this would be the part where she blushes and runs away.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Or collapses.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Or anything equally...Karin-ish.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But instead, she just looks at me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Speaking nothing.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Doing nothing.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Just...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Staring.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please watch over her.",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene kandasoutside18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/kandasoutside18.webp",
      "alt": "kandasoutside18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And then she leaves.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please watch over me, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I keep getting into trouble and need someone like you to bail me out.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know she was just looking out for you, right?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know she’s just obligated to do that since she’s the older sister, right?",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s her job to make sure I don’t talk about fucking my future teacher in public and it’s my job to sneak into her closet and cut her dresses into pieces.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I really hope that’s not a thing you do to her.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not anymore, it’s not. Being grounded for two months was not a good time.",
      "spk": "Kirin",
      "spkColor": "#9C8080",
